ir phase one and this is a  great idea and this will help with the  cohesiveness and the connectivity of the  universe but real quick let's go back to  that first tweet where James Gunn said  some of the story is true some of it is  half true some of it not at all and some  of it is undecided well the cancellation  of Wonder Woman 3. I believe that is  most likely true let's be honest Wonder  Woman 2 wasn't that good Wonder Woman  the first one is one of my favorite  movies of all time but but the second  one was kind of a flop if you liked it  good for you I'm happy but most people I  think thought it wasn't very good and  seeing as how James Gunn is probably  going to reboot a lot of the universe  perhaps it's possible that the direction  that Wonder Woman was heading in and the  story of Wonder Woman 3 was just not  fitting for the universe which sounds  like is the case now the big question is  though will Wonder Woman be sticking  around and will Gal Gadot be playing her  that's something that we might not have  an answer to yet that could be one of  the things that James Gunn says that  they haven't decided on yet I personally  think that it would be a good idea to  keep her as Wonder Woman I think she  does a great job as Wonder Woman if the  direction and the script are right if  they're good but let me know what you  think about gal gadot's Wonder Woman now  the other really big question is Man of  Steel 2 and Henry Cavill are they  sticking around I think fans really  really wanted Henry Cavill back as  Superman and the Rock himself and Henry  Cavill himself made a pretty big deal  about this now granted this was before  James Gunn and Peter that friend were in  charge but like James Gunn said they're  going to do everything they can for the  characters and for the fans and the  stories so that leads me to believe  because James Gunn is an incredibly  smart man that Henry Cavill is probably  sticking around however again plans that  they might have had for